{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short fishing game early in development :-). Collect fish population samples for WDOE as you rebuild a once great public transportation network with the help of your new REALLY REALLY cool bird friends. Also unlock a bunch of new areas, fishing rods and upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock new fishing rods with unique visuals and abilites<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/fishing.gif?t=1742250640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch neat fish<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/fish.gif?t=1742250640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your fishing rod loadout with active and passive upgrades </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/items.gif?t=1742250640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build relationships with really cool birds </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/owl.gif?t=1742250640\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Rebuild train network and unlock new areas to fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809450/extras/map.gif?t=1742250640\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2809450?t=1742250640","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2809450?t=174225064